  FT["PH-H1143"] = {"id":"PH-H1143","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra1955/ra_1309_1955.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"拨付特定款项作为已故众议员洛伦佐·P·齐加与格雷戈里奥·B·坦子女抚恤金的法案","en":"An Act Appropriating Certain Sums to be Paid as Compensation to the Children of the Late Representatives Lorenzo P. Ziga and Gregorio B. Tan","orig":"An Act Appropriating Certain Sums to be Paid as Compensation to the Children of the Late Representatives Lorenzo P. Ziga and Gregorio B. Tan","vi":"Đạo luật cấp khoản tiền nhất định để chi trả tiền bồi thường cho con cái của các Đại biểu Quốc hội quá cố Lorenzo P. Ziga và Gregorio B. Tan","th":"พระราชบัญญัติจัดสรรงบประมาณจำนวนหนึ่งเพื่อจ่ายเป็นค่าชดเชยให้กับบุตรของสมาชิกสภาผู้แทนราษฎรผู้ล่วงลับแล้ว ลอเรนโซ พี ซิกา และเกรโกเรียว บี ทาน","id":"Undang-Undang mengalokasikan sejumlah dana tertentu untuk dibayarkan sebagai kompensasi kepada anak-anak mantan anggota Dewan Perwakilan Rakyat Lorenzo P. Ziga dan Gregorio B. Tan","ms":"Akta mengperuntukkan jumlah tertentu untuk dibayar sebagai pampasan kepada anak-anak ahli Dewan Perwakilan Rakyat yang telah meninggal dunia, Lorenzo P. Ziga dan Gregorio B. Tan"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["civil"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 1309","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"1955-06-16","completenessNote":"全文，共 2 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra1955/ra_1309_1955.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H1143-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"Out of any funds in the National Treasury not otherwise appropriated, the sum of fifteen thousand four hundred eighty-one pesos and twenty-nine centavos is appropriated to be paid as compensation to the children of the late Representative Lorenzo P. Ziga, and the sum of fifteen thousand four hundred eighty-one pesos and twenty-nine centavos is appropriated to be paid as compensation to the children of the late Representative Gregorio B. Tan, both of whom died in line of duty. These amounts shall be exempt from all kinds of taxes."}},{"id":"PH-H1143-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"This Act shall take effect upon its approval.\nApproved: June 16, 1955."}}],"pack":"ph-p16"};
