  FT["PH-H1153"] = {"id":"PH-H1153","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra1955/ra_1319_1955.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"设立描笼涯圣何塞、马里卡班岛、巴旺市镇、八打雁省的法案","en":"An Act Creating the Barrio of San Jose, Maricaban Island, Municipality of Bauan, Province of Batangas","orig":"An Act Creating the Barrio of San Jose, Maricaban Island, Municipality of Bauan, Province of Batangas","vi":"Đạo luật thành lập Barangay San Jose trên đảo Maricaban, thuộc Thành phố trực thuộc tỉnh Bauan, Tỉnh Batangas","th":"พระราชบัญญัติจัดตั้งบารังไกย์ซานโฮเซบนเกาะมาเรียกาบันเทศบาลบาอวนจังหวัดบาตังกัส","id":"Undang-Undang menciptakan Barangay San Jose, Pulau Maricaban, Kotamadya Bauan, Provinsi Batangas","ms":"Akta mencipta Barangay San Jose, Pulau Maricaban, Perbandaran Bauan, Wilayah Batangas"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["general"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 1319","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"1955-06-16","completenessNote":"全文，共 2 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra1955/ra_1319_1955.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H1153-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"The sitio of Pinagcurusan in the barrio of Maricaban and the sitio of Pinagcurusan in the barrio of Tingloy in the Island of Maricaban, Municipality of Bauan, Province of Batangas, are separated from said barrios and constituted into a separate and independent barrio of said municipality, to be known as the barrio of San Jose."}},{"id":"PH-H1153-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"This Act shall take effect upon its approval.\nApproved: June 16, 1955."}}],"pack":"ph-p16"};
  FT["PH-H1154"] = {"id":"PH-H1154","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra1955/ra_1320_1955.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"设立Bauan市","en":"An Act Creating the Barrio of San Juan in Maricaban Island, Municipality of Bauan, Province of Batangas","orig":"An Act Creating the Barrio of San Juan in Maricaban Island, Municipality of Bauan, Province of Batangas","vi":"Đạo luật thành lập một Barrio San Juan tại Đô thị Bauan, Tỉnh Batangas","th":"พระราชบัญญัติจัดตั้งบาริโอ San Juan ในเทศบาล Bauan จังหวัด Batangas","id":"Undang-Undang membentuk sebuah Barrio San Juan di Kotamadya Bauan, Provinsi Batangas","ms":"Akta menubuhkan sebuah Barrio San Juan di Perbandaran Bauan, Wilayah Batangas"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["general"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 1320","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"1955-06-16","completenessNote":"全文，共 2 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra1955/ra_1320_1955.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H1154-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"The sitio of Pirasan in the barrio of Payapa, Maricaban Island, Municipality of Bauan, Province of Batangas, is separated from the said barrio of Payapa and constituted into a separate and independent barrio of said municipality, to be known as the barrio of San Juan."}},{"id":"PH-H1154-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"This Act shall take effect upon its approval.\nApproved: June 16, 1955."}}],"pack":"ph-p16"};
  FT["PH-H1155"] = {"id":"PH-H1155","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra1955/ra_1321_1955.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"设立Mabini市","en":"An Act Creating the Barrio of Masara in the Municipality of Mabini, Province of Davao","orig":"An Act Creating the Barrio of Masara in the Municipality of Mabini, Province of Davao","vi":"Đạo luật thành lập một Barrio Masara tại Đô thị Mabini, Tỉnh Davao","th":"พระราชบัญญัติจัดตั้งบาริโอ Masara ในเทศบาล Mabini จังหวัด Davao","id":"Undang-Undang membentuk sebuah Barrio Masara di Kotamadya Mabini, Provinsi Davao","ms":"Akta menubuhkan sebuah Barrio Masara di Perbandaran Mabini, Wilayah Davao"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["general"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 1321","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"1955-06-16","completenessNote":"全文，共 2 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra1955/ra_1321_1955.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H1155-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"The following territory is created as a barrio in the Municipality of Mabini, Province of Davao, to be known as the barrio of Masara. It shall be bounded on the North by the Compostela boundary; on the South by mountain ranges; on the West by sitio Panibasan; and on the East by the Municipality of Caraga."}},{"id":"PH-H1155-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"This Act shall take effect upon its approval.\nApproved: June 16, 1955."}}],"pack":"ph-p16"};
  FT["PH-H1156"] = {"id":"PH-H1156","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra1955/ra_1322_1955.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":8,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"从第1000号共和国法所授权发行的债券中筹措资金，用于人民住宅用地与住宅公司项目的法案","en":"An Act to Finance People’s Homesite and Housing Corporation Projects from the Bond Issue Under Republic Act Numbered One Thousand","orig":"An Act to Finance People’s Homesite and Housing Corporation Projects from the Bond Issue Under Republic Act Numbered One Thousand","vi":"Đạo luật tài trợ các dự án của Công ty Đất nền và Nhà ở Nhân dân từ khoản phát hành trái phiếu theo Đạo luật Cộng hòa số 1000","th":"พระราชบัญญัติระดมทุนสำหรับโครงการบริษัทที่ดินและที่อยู่อาศัยของประชาชนจากพันธบัตรที่ออกตามพระราชบัญญัติสาธารณรัฐฉบับที่๑๐๐๐","id":"Undang-Undang membiayai proyek Perusahaan Tanah dan Perumahan Rakyat dari penerbitan obligasi berdasarkan Undang-Undang Republik Nomor 1000","ms":"Akta membiayai projek Syarikat Tanah dan Perumahan Rakyat daripada isu bon di bawah Akta Republik Nombor 1000"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["general"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 1322","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"1955-06-16","completenessNote":"全文，共 8 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra1955/ra_1322_1955.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H1156-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"Subject to allocation by the President of the Philippines under the terms of Republic Act Numbered One thousand and subject to such rules and regulations as he may prescribe, the sum of twenty million pesos from the proceeds of the sales of bonds to be issued under Republic Act Numbered One thousand shall be reserved and utilized for projects of the People’s Homesite and Housing Corporation, as follows:\n1. Construction of low-cost housing project, including site acquisition;\n2. Acquisition and subdivision of landed estates for resale without structures;\n3. Acquisition and clearance of slum areas; and\n4. Construction of housing for destitutes and paupers."}},{"id":"PH-H1156-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"The first two types of projects shall be self-liquidating projects, while the last two shall be non-self-liquidating and non-revenue-producing projects. When a slum area is to be acquired and cleared for construction of a low-cost housing project, the cost of acquiring and clearing the area shall be non-self-liquidating, while the cost of constructing the housing project thereon shall be self-liquidating."}},{"id":"PH-H1156-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3."},"text":{"en":"To bring the dwelling units in its housing projects within the reach of families belonging to the lowest economic class possible, the People’s Homesite and Housing Corporation is authorized to amortize the cost of said projects for a period longer than, but not exceeding twice the redemption period of the bonds, and to contribute to the sinking fund under section two of Republic Act Numbered One thousand only the net income of said projects. However, when the bonds near maturity, the estimated deficiency and the People’s Homesite and Housing Corporation contribution to the sinking fund shall be raised from another set of bonds to be sold under the provisions of this Act and Republic Act Numbered One thousand."}},{"id":"PH-H1156-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4."},"text":{"en":"Any housing project to be financed under this Act shall be undertaken through public bidding, but if there are no bidders or if the project can be executed at a reasonably lower cost than the lowest bid, such project may be executed by administration."}},{"id":"PH-H1156-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5."},"text":{"en":"The acquisition of landed estates that may be financed under this Act shall be limited only to urban lands intended for residential purposes, without prejudice to setting aside appropriate areas for public and semi-public areas needed by the community."}},{"id":"PH-H1156-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6."},"text":{"en":"The construction of housing for destitutes and paupers shall not be undertaken, unless the Social Welfare Administration or any government agency designated by the President to operate the same, is provided with, or assured of, funds to maintain and operate the same."}},{"id":"PH-H1156-A7","no":7,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 7."},"text":{"en":"All the projects of the People’s Homesite and Housing Corporation financed under this Act shall be exempt from national and local taxes and fees of any kind."}},{"id":"PH-H1156-A8","no":8,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 8."},"text":{"en":"This Act shall take effect upon its approval.\nApproved: June 16, 1955."}}],"pack":"ph-p16","titleTranslation":{"engine":"manual-llm","reviewed":false,"source":"An Act to Finance People’s Homesite and Housing Corporation Projects from the Bond Issue Under Republic Act Numbered One Thousand","note":"人工逐条翻译（模型产出，未经人工复核）；公司名、地名、机构名保留原文。"}};
  FT["PH-H1157"] = {"id":"PH-H1157","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra1955/ra_1323_1955.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"在苏里高省苏里高市镇设立塔利赛、林隆加南、苏凯朗与比亚比德描笼涯的法案","en":"An Act to Create the Barrios of Talisay, Linungganan, Sukailang, and Biyabid, in the Municipality of Surigao, Province of Surigao","orig":"An Act to Create the Barrios of Talisay, Linungganan, Sukailang, and Biyabid, in the Municipality of Surigao, Province of Surigao","vi":"Đạo luật thành lập các barangay Talisay, Linungganan, Sukailang và Biyabid tại thị xã Surigao, tỉnh Surigao","th":"พระราชบัญญัติจัดตั้งบารังไกย์ตาลิสายลินุงกาแนนสุไกหลังและบิยาบิดในอำเภอซูริเกาจังหวัดซูริเกา","id":"Undang-Undang membentuk barangay Talisay, Linungganan, Sukailang, dan Biyabid di Kotamadya Surigao, Provinsi Surigao","ms":"Akta menubuhkan barangay Talisay, Linungganan, Sukailang dan Biyabid di Perbandaran Surigao, Wilayah Surigao"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["general"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 1323","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"1955-06-16","completenessNote":"全文，共 2 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra1955/ra_1323_1955.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H1157-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"The sitios of Talisay, Linungganan, Sukailang, and Biyabid, in the Municipality of Surigao, Province of Surigao, are hereby constituted into barrios in the same municipality, to be known as Talisay, Linungganan, Sukailang and Biyabid, respectively."}},{"id":"PH-H1157-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"This Act shall take effect upon its approval.\nApproved: June 16, 1955."}}],"pack":"ph-p16","titleTranslation":{"engine":"llm","model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","reviewed":false,"batch":"CALR-TITLE-20261017-1837-PH-7575","source":"An Act to Create the Barrios of Talisay, Linungganan, Sukailang, and Biyabid, in the Municipality of Surigao, Province of Surigao","note":"由翻译 agent 按《法规标题中译规范》产出，经 tools/verify-title-return.js 机器校验后入库；尚未人工复核。"}};
  FT["PH-H1158"] = {"id":"PH-H1158","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra1955/ra_1324_1955.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"本法案规定在Lipa市辖区内新设立Bungahan行政村","en":"An Act to Create the Barrio of Bungahan in the City of Lipa","orig":"An Act to Create the Barrio of Bungahan in the City of Lipa","vi":"Đạo luật thành lập Barrio Bungahan tại Thành phố Lipa","th":"พระราชบัญญัติจัดตั้งบาริโอ Bungahan ในเมือง Lipa","id":"Undang-Undang membentuk Barrio Bungahan di Kota Lipa","ms":"Akta menubuhkan Barrio Bungahan di Bandar Lipa"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["general"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 1324","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"1955-06-16","completenessNote":"全文，共 2 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra1955/ra_1324_1955.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H1158-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"The sitios of Duhatan, Tagbakin, Initan, Malabong and Halang, all in the barrio of Pinagtungolan, City of Lipa, are separated from the said barrio, and constituted into a separate barrio in the said city to be known as the barrio of Bungahan."}},{"id":"PH-H1158-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"This Act shall take effect upon its approval.\nApproved: June 16, 1955."}}],"pack":"ph-p16","titleTranslation":{"engine":"llm","model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","reviewed":false,"batch":"CALR-TITLE-20261017-1837-PH-7575","source":"An Act to Create the Barrio of Bungahan in the City of Lipa","note":"由翻译 agent 按《法规标题中译规范》产出，经 tools/verify-title-return.js 机器校验后入库；尚未人工复核。"}};
  FT["PH-H1159"] = {"id":"PH-H1159","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra1955/ra_1325_1955.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"将卡加延德奥罗市市长、副市长及市议会全体成员职位改为民选，并为此修正第521号共和国法若干条款的法案","en":"An Act Making Elective the Positions of Mayor and Vice-Mayor and the Entire Membership of the Municipal Board of the City of Cagayan De Oro, Amending for This Purpose Certain Sections of Republic Act Numbered Five Hundred Twenty-One","orig":"An Act Making Elective the Positions of Mayor and Vice-Mayor and the Entire Membership of the Municipal Board of the City of Cagayan De Oro, Amending for This Purpose Certain Sections of Republic Act Numbered Five Hundred Twenty-One","vi":"Đạo luật chuyển đổi vị trí Thị trưởng và Phó Thị trưởng cùng toàn bộ Thành viên Hội đồng Thị xã thành chức vụ do bầu cử ở Thành phố Cagayan de Oro, đồng thời sửa đổi một số điều khoản của Đạo luật Cộng hòa số 521 vì mục đích này","th":"พระราชบัญญัติกำหนดให้ตำแหน่งนายกเทศมนตรีและรองนายกเทศมนตรีรวมทั้งสมาชิกสภาเทศบาลทั้งหมดของนครกาคายันเดโอโรเป็นตำแหน่งที่มาจากการเลือกตั้งและแก้ไขบางมาตราของพระราชบัญญัติสาธารณรัฐฉบับที่ห้าร้อยยี่สิบเอ็ดเพื่อวัตถุประสงค์นี้","id":"Undang-Undang menjadikan jabatan Walikota dan Wakil Walikota serta seluruh anggota Dewan Kota Cagayan de Oro dipilih secara langsung, serta mengubah beberapa pasal dalam Undang-Undang Republik Nomor 521 untuk tujuan ini","ms":"Akta menjadikan jawatan Datuk Bandar dan Timbalan Datuk Bandar serta keseluruhan keahlian Majlis Bandaraya Bandaraya Cagayan de Oro dipilih secara langsung dan mengubah beberapa seksyen dalam Akta Republik Nombor Lima Ratus Dua Puluh Satu untuk tujuan ini"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["general"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 1325","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"1955-06-16","completenessNote":"全文，共 3 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra1955/ra_1325_1955.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H1159-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"Sections seven, eight and eleven of Republic Act Numbered Five hundred twenty-one, otherwise known as the Charter of the City of Cagayan de Oro, are amended to read as follows:\nSec. 7. The Mayor. The Mayor shall be the chief executive of the city. He shall be elected by the qualified voters of the city during every election for provincial and municipal officials in accordance with the provisions of the Revised Election Code. No person shall be eligible for the position of mayor unless he is at least twenty-five years of age, a qualified voter and a resident of the city for not less than one year immediately preceding his election.\nHe shall receive a salary of not exceeding six thousand pesos a year. With the approval of the Secretary of Finance, the Mayor may be provided, in addition to his salary, a non-commutable allowance of not exceeding five thousand pesos per annum.\nSec. 8. The Vice-Mayor. There shall be a Vice-Mayor who shall perform the duties of the Mayor, in the event of the sickness, absence or other temporary incapacity of the Mayor, or in the event of a definitive vacancy in the position of the mayor, until said office shall be filled in accordance with law. He shall be elected in the same manner and shall possess the same qualifications as the mayor. If for any reason, the Vice-Mayor is temporarily incapacitated for the performance of the duties of the office of mayor or said office of the Vice-Mayor is vacant, the duties of the Mayor shall be performed by the city treasurer. The acting mayor shall have the same powers and duties as the mayor.\nThe Vice-Mayor shall be a member of the Municipal Board and shall perform such other duties as may be assigned to him by the mayor or prescribed by law or ordinance. He shall receive a salary not exceeding three thousand six hundred pesos per annum: Provided , That when he acts as mayor his salary shall be equivalent to that of the Mayor.\nSec. 11. Constitution and organization of the Municipal Board. compensation of members thereof. The Municipal Board shall be the legislative body of the city and shall be composed of the Mayor, who shall be its presiding officer, the Vice-Mayor and seven councilors elected at large by popular vote during every election for provincial and municipal officials in conformity with the provisions of the Revised Election Code. In case of sickness, absence, suspension or other temporary disability of any member of the Board, or if necessary to maintain a quorum, the President of the Philippines may appoint a temporary substitute belonging to the same political party as the temporarily incapacitated member who shall possess all the rights and perform all the duties of a member of the Board until the return to duty of the regular incumbent.\nIf any member of the Municipal Board should be candidate for office in any election, he shall be disqualified to act with the Board in the discharge of the duties conferred upon it relative to election matters, in such case the other members of the Board shall discharge said duties without his assistance, or they may choose a disinterested elector of the city to act with the Board in such matters in his stead.\nThe members of the Municipal Board shall receive per diem in provided for in Republic Act Numbered Eight hundred forty.\""}},{"id":"PH-H1159-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"The appointive mayor and vice-mayor and all the councilors who are serving as such on the date of the approval of this Act shall continue in office until their successors are elected and have qualified in the next general election for provincial and municipal officials in conformity with the provisions of the Revised Penal Code."}},{"id":"PH-H1159-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3."},"text":{"en":"This Act shall take effect upon its approval."}}],"pack":"ph-p16","titleTranslation":{"engine":"llm","model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","reviewed":false,"batch":"CALR-TITLE-20261017-1837-PH-7575","source":"An Act Making Elective the Positions of Mayor and Vice-Mayor and the Entire Membership of the Municipal Board of the City of Cagayan De Oro, Amending for This Purpose Certain Sections of Republic Act Numbered Five Hundred Twenty-One","note":"由翻译 agent 按《法规标题中译规范》产出，经 tools/verify-title-return.js 机器校验后入库；尚未人工复核。"}};
  FT["PH-H1160"] = {"id":"PH-H1160","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra1955/ra_1326_1955.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"将巴拉望省布鲁克斯波因特市镇塔尼翁博博格村的名称变更为萨拉萨村的法案","en":"An Act Changing the Name of the Barrio of Taniongbobog, Municipality of Brooke’s Point, Province of Palawan, to Saraza","orig":"An Act Changing the Name of the Barrio of Taniongbobog, Municipality of Brooke’s Point, Province of Palawan, to Saraza","vi":"Đạo luật đổi tên Barrio Taniongbobog, Thị trấn Brooke’s Point, Tỉnh Palawan thành Saraza","th":"พระราชบัญญัติเปลี่ยนชื่อบาริโอ Taniongbobog, เทศบาล Brooke’s Point, จังหวัด Palawan เป็น Saraza","id":"Undang-Undang mengubah nama Barrio Taniongbobog, Kotamadya Brooke’s Point, Provinsi Palawan menjadi Saraza","ms":"Akta menukar nama Barrio Taniongbobog, Perbandaran Brooke’s Point, Wilayah Palawan kepada Saraza"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["general"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 1326","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"1955-06-16","completenessNote":"全文，共 2 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra1955/ra_1326_1955.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H1160-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"The name of barrio of Taniongbobog, Municipality of Brooke’s Point, Province of Palawan, is changed to Saraza."}},{"id":"PH-H1160-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"This Act shall take effect upon its approval Approved: June 16, 1955."}}],"pack":"ph-p16","titleTranslation":{"engine":"llm","model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","reviewed":false,"batch":"CALR-TITLE-20261017-1837-PH-7575","source":"An Act Changing the Name of the Barrio of Taniongbobog, Municipality of Brooke’s Point, Province of Palawan, to Saraza","note":"由翻译 agent 按《法规标题中译规范》产出，经 tools/verify-title-return.js 机器校验后入库；尚未人工复核。"}};
  FT["PH-H1161"] = {"id":"PH-H1161","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra1955/ra_1327_1955.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":4,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"修订武端市宪章若干条款的法案","en":"An Act to Amend Certain Provisions of the Charter of the City of Butuan","orig":"An Act to Amend Certain Provisions of the Charter of the City of Butuan","vi":"Đạo luật sửa đổi một số điều của Hiến chương Thành phố Butuan","th":"พระราชบัญญัติแก้ไขเพิ่มเติมบางมาตราแห่งกฎบัตรเมือง Butuan","id":"Undang-Undang mengubah beberapa pasal Piagam Kota Butuan","ms":"Akta meminda beberapa seksyen Piagam Bandar Butuan"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["general"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 1327","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"1955-06-16","completenessNote":"全文，共 4 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra1955/ra_1327_1955.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H1161-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"Section seven of Republic Act Numbered Five hundred twenty-three, otherwise known as the Charter of the city of Butuan, is amended to read as follows:\n\"Sec. 7. The Mayor— His election, qualifications and compensation. — The Mayor shall be the chief executive of the city. He shall be elected by the qualified voters of the city during every election for provincial and municipal officials in conformity with the provisions of the Revised Election Code. No person shall be elected mayor unless he is at least twenty-five years of age, a resident of the city for at least two years prior to his election, and a qualified voter therein.\n\"He shall receive compensation as provided in Republic Act Numbered Eight hundred forty, entitled \"An Act classifying chartered cities, except Manila, Baguio and Quezon Cities, according to their annual revenues and fixing the salaries of the officials thereof.\""}},{"id":"PH-H1161-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"Section eight of the same Act is amended to read as follows:\n\"Sec. 8. The Vice-Mayor— His election, qualifications, duties and compensation. — There shall be a vice-mayor who shall be elected in the same manner as the mayor and shall at the time of his election possess the same qualifications as the mayor. He shall perform the duties of the mayor, in the event of the sickness, absence or other temporary incapacity of the mayor, or in the event of a definitive vacancy in the position of mayor. If, for any reason, the vice-mayor is temporarily incapacitated for the performance of the duties of the office of the mayor, or said office of the vice-mayor is vacant, the duties of the Mayor shall be performed by the councilor who obtained the highest number of votes. The acting mayor shall have the same powers and duties as the mayor.\n\"The vice-mayor shall perform such other duties as may be assigned to him by the mayor or prescribed by law or ordinance. He shall receive a salary of not exceeding three thousand pesos per annum.\""}},{"id":"PH-H1161-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3."},"text":{"en":"Section eleven of the same Act is amended to read as follows:\n\"Sec. 11. Constitution and organization of the Municipal Board— Compensation of members thereof. — The Municipal Board shall be the legislative body of the city and shall be composed of the vice-mayor, who shall be its presiding officer, and six councilors who shall be elected at large by popular vote during every election for provincial and municipal officials in conformity with the provisions of the Revised Election Code. In case of sickness, absence, suspension or other temporary disability of any member of the Board, or if necessary to maintain a quorum, the President of the Philippines may appoint a temporary substitute who shall possess all the rights and perform all the duties of a member of the Board until the return to duty of the regular incumbent.\n\"If any member of the Municipal Board should be a candidate for office in any election, he shall be disqualified to act with the Board in the discharge of the duties conferred upon it relative to election matters, and in such case the other members of the Board shall discharge said duties without his assistance, or they may choose some disinterested elector of the city to act with the Board in such matters in his stead.\n\"The members of the Municipal Board shall receive compensation as provided in Republic Act Numbered Eight hundred forty.\""}},{"id":"PH-H1161-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4."},"text":{"en":"This Act shall take effect upon its approval: Provided, That the incumbent appointive Mayor and vice-mayor of the City of Butuan shall continue to hold office and the present composition of the Municipal Board of said city shall likewise continue until the elective City Mayor, vice-mayor and councilors provided for in this Act shall have been elected in the next regular election for provincial and municipal officials and shall have qualified.\nApproved: June 16, 1955."}}],"pack":"ph-p16","titleTranslation":{"engine":"llm","model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","reviewed":false,"batch":"CALR-TITLE-20261017-1837-PH-7575","source":"An Act to Amend Certain Provisions of the Charter of the City of Butuan","note":"由翻译 agent 按《法规标题中译规范》产出，经 tools/verify-title-return.js 机器校验后入库；尚未人工复核。"}};
  FT["PH-H1162"] = {"id":"PH-H1162","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra1955/ra_1328_1955.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":6,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"修订第 632 号共和国法，扩大菲律宾糖业研究所的权力、职能与职责、规定其经费并为其他目的","en":"An Act to Amend Republic Act Numbered Six Hundred and Thirty-Two, by Enlarging the Powers, Functions and Duties of the Philippine Sugar Institute, Providing for the Financing Thereof, and for Other Purposes","orig":"An Act to Amend Republic Act Numbered Six Hundred and Thirty-Two, by Enlarging the Powers, Functions and Duties of the Philippine Sugar Institute, Providing for the Financing Thereof, and for Other Purposes","vi":"Đạo luật sửa đổi Đạo luật Cộng hòa số 632, và cho các mục đích khác","th":"พระราชบัญญัติแก้ไขเพิ่มเติมพระราชบัญญัติแห่งสาธารณรัฐที่ 632 และเพื่อวัตถุประสงค์อื่น","id":"Undang-Undang mengubah Undang-Undang Republik No. 632, dan untuk tujuan lain","ms":"Akta meminda Akta Republik No. 632, dan untuk tujuan lain"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["environment"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 1328","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"1955-06-16","completenessNote":"全文，共 6 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra1955/ra_1328_1955.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。 源文存在同号重出的条款（第 2、3 条）：该处官方页面确有两段均标同一 Section 号，本库照录其 `no` 值（不改动官方编号），条文 `id` 以 `_2`「_3」后缀保证唯一。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H1162-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"Section two of Republic Act Numbered Six hundred and thirty-two is hereby amended to read as follows:"}},{"id":"PH-H1162-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"Purposes and Objectives. The PHILSUGIN shall have the following purposes and objectives:\n(a) To conduct research work for the sugar industry in all its phases, either agricultural or industrial, for the purpose of introducing into the sugar industry such practices or processes that will reduce the cost of production, increase and improve the industrialization of the by-products of sugar cane, and achieve greater efficiency in the industry;\n(b) To improve existing methods of raising sugar cane and of sugar manufacturing;\n(c) To insure a permanent, sufficient and balanced production of sugar and its by-products for local consumption and exportation;\n(d) To establish and maintain such balanced relation between production and consumption of sugar and its by-products, and such marketing conditions thereof, as will insure stabilized prices at a level sufficient to cover the cost of production plus a reasonable profit;\n(e) To promote the effective merchandising of sugar and its by-products in the domestic and foreign markets so that those engaged in the sugar industry will be placed on a basis of economic security;\n(f) To improve the living and economic conditions of laborers engaged in the sugar industry by the gradual and effective correction of the inequalities existing in the industry; and\n(g) To finance the activities of the sugar industry, or any of its component elements, where such assistance is needed and conducive to the progress of the industry in all its phases.\""}},{"id":"PH-H1162-A2-d2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"Section three of Republic Act Numbered Six hundred and thirty-two is hereby amended to read as follows:"},"dupIndex":2},{"id":"PH-H1162-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3."},"text":{"en":"Specific and General Powers. For carrying out the purposes mentioned in the preceding section, the PHILSUGIN shall have the following powers:\n(a) To establish, keep, maintain and operate, or help establish, keep, maintain, and operate one central experiment station and such number of regional experimental stations in any part of the Philippines as may be necessary to undertake extensive research in sugar cane culture and manufacture, including studies as to the feasibility of mechanizing sugar cane farms, the control and eradication of pests, the selection and propagation of high-yielding varieties of sugar cane suited to Philippine climatic conditions, and such other pertinent studies as will be useful in adjusting the sugar industry to a position independent of existing trade preference in the American market;\n(b) To purchase such machineries, materials, equipment, and supplies as may be necessary to prosecute successfully such researches and experimental work;\n(c) To explore and expand the domestic and foreign markets for sugar and its by-products to assure mutual benefits to consumers and producers, and to promote and maintain a sufficient general production of sugar and its by-products by an efficient coordination of the component elements of the sugar industry of the country;\n(d) To buy, sell, assign, own, operate, rent or lease, subject to existing laws, machineries, equipment, materials, merchant vessels, rails, railroad lines, and any other means of transportation, warehouses, buildings, and any other equipment and material for the production, manufacture, handling, transportation and warehousing of sugar and its by-products;\n(e) To borrow or raise or secure money for the purpose of meeting the financial needs of the industry, the growers and the millers; to issue bonds and debentures to carry out the purposes and objectives outlined in Chapter one of this Act;\n(f) To provide credit facilities and/or loans, on reasonable terms, to sugar cane growers and/or millers when it deems such loans advisable;\n(g) To enter, make and execute contracts of any kind as may be necessary or incidental to the attainment of its purposes with any person, firm, or public or private corporation, with the Government of the Philippines or of the United States, of any state, territory or persons thereof or with any foreign government and, in general, to do everything directly or indirectly necessary or incidental to, or in furtherance of, the purposes of the corporation;\n(h) To do all such other things, transact all such business and perform such functions directly or indirectly necessary, incidental or conducive to the attainment of the purposes of the corporation; and\n(i) Generally, to exercise all the powers of a corporation under the Corporation Law insofar as they are not inconsistent with the provisions of this Act.\""}},{"id":"PH-H1162-A3-d2","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3."},"text":{"en":"A section is hereby inserted between sections sixteen and seventeen of Republic Act Numbered Six hundred and thirty-two, to be known as section sixteen-A, to read as follows:\nSection 16- A. The proceeds of all collections made under Commonwealth Act Numbered Five hundred and sixty-seven, shall constitute a special fund and accrue to the Sugar Research and Stabilization Fund which shall likewise be available for the maintenance, operation and use of the Philippine Sugar Institute.\""},"dupIndex":2},{"id":"PH-H1162-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4."},"text":{"en":"This Act shall take effect upon its approval.\nApproved: June 16, 1955."}}],"pack":"ph-p16","titleTranslation":{"engine":"llm","model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","reviewed":false,"batch":"CALR-TITLE-20261017-1837-PH-7575","source":"An Act to Amend Republic Act Numbered Six Hundred and Thirty-Two, by Enlarging the Powers, Functions and Duties of the Philippine Sugar Institute, Providing for the Financing Thereof, and for Other Purposes","note":"由翻译 agent 按《法规标题中译规范》产出，经 tools/verify-title-return.js 机器校验后入库；尚未人工复核。"}};
